        <mxCell id="emitter" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e6d0de;strokeColor=#996185;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="SpdxEmitter (app/spdx/emitter.py)&#xa;&#xa;Assembles SPDX 2.3 JSON:&#xa;- Document metadata (namespace, creators)&#xa;- Root binary package&#xa;- Static-link packages (from infile: records)&#xa;- Dynamic-link packages (from dynlib:)&#xa;- Build tool packages (gcc, ld)&#xa;- Source file entries (.c, .h)&#xa;- ExternalRefs: PURL, CPE, gitoid" vertex="1">
